            0.885,
            0.186
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "To get around this issue, we can put out an extra zero pair (a positive and a negative), knowing that this does not change the value of the set of tokens."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.189,
            0.577,
            0.231
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Now, we can take out 6 positives! See what is left:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.587,
            0.187,
            0.882,
            0.225
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 5,
              "bbox": [
                0.587,
                0.187,
                0.882,
                0.225
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_16_image_5.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.194,
            0.235,
            0.546,
            0.254
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "We conclude that (+5) – (+6) = –1."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.166,
            0.268,
            0.353,
            0.289
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Figure it Out"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.209,
            0.298,
            0.884,
            0.386
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. Evaluate the following differences using tokens. Check that you get the same result as with other methods you now know: a. (+ 10) – (+ 7) b. (– 8) – (– 4) c. (– 9) – (– 4) d. (+ 9) – (+ 12) e. (– 5) – (– 7) f. (– 2) – (– 6)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.208,
            0.389,
            0.82,
            0.454
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. Complete the subtractions: a. (– 5) – (– 7) b. (+ 10) – (+ 13) c. (– 7) – (– 9) d. (+ 3) – (+ 8) e. (– 2) – (– 7) f. (+ 3) – (+ 15)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.194,
            0.469,
            0.413,
            0.488
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Example: + 4 – (–6)."
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.194,
            0.492,
            0.43,
            0.512
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Start with 4 positives."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.708,
            0.478,
            0.878,
            0.509
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 12,
              "bbox": [
                0.708,
                0.478,
                0.878,
                0.509
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_16_image_12.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.516,
            0.884,
            0.558
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "We have to take out 6 negatives from these. But there are not enough negatives."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.561,
            0.884,
            0.604
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "This is not a problem. We add some zero pairs as this does not change the value of the set of tokens."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.606,
            0.884,
            0.65
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "But how many zero pairs? We have to take away 6 negatives so we put down 6 zero pairs:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.267,
            0.658,
            0.78,
            0.738
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 16,
              "bbox": [
                0.267,
                0.658,
                0.78,
                0.738
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_16_image_16.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.195,
            0.755,
            0.566,
            0.774
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Now we can take away 6 negatives:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.207,
            0.869,
            0.473,
            0.888
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Therefore, +4– (–6)=+10."
            }
          ]
